{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RvR5bi0SGs1794823223.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近期市場氣氛正面，馬鞍山大型屋苑迎海本月暫錄3宗成交，最新錄一期3座低層A室，實用面積496平方呎，2房連儲物房間隔，開價約745萬元，議價後以718萬元易手，實用平均呎價14,476元。<br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為上車客，見單位間隔合用，少有放盤，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2012年以467萬元購入單位，持貨約14年，是次轉手賬面獲利251萬元或53.7%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:43:56.267387+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:13.812133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:13.812133+00:00","content_hash":"4afe9a3b2f9b5bb53e32f4499f6617c1ee6861404dafb5c8c4aaff5d57174d89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}